  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CFTM Savalou | Cassava Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cassava processing..Beneficiaries: 1000 (620 women)..Description: The group seeks to increase gari production and quality through construction of processing workshops and warehouses for each of the 15 member groups. Provision of mobile processing equipment (cassava graters and presses) and training will result in increased production and improved quality to obtain higher prices. Improved access to working capital will also facilitate access to raw materials to increase production.</narrative>
  </description>
